# MedAssist AI — Frontend Environment Variables Example

# Backend REST API Endpoint Base URL
# Production (Render): https://medassistai-1-weid.onrender.com/api
# Local development: http://localhost:8000/api
VITE_API_URL="https://medassistai-1-weid.onrender.com/api"
VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://medassistai-1-weid.onrender.com/api"

# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Frontend GIS SDK / One-Tap)
# Obtain from Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID="your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com"

# Microsoft Azure AD OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Frontend MSAL / OAuth Popup)
# Obtain from Azure Portal (Microsoft Entra ID): https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_AAD_IAM/ActiveDirectoryMenuBlade/RegisteredApps
VITE_MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID="your-microsoft-client-id-guid"
